# Prettier's default ignore list is node_modules and nothing else, so without
# this `pnpm run format` rewrote build output — dist/*.d.ts, the demo bundle,
# and test-results/.last-run.json — on every run. Two problems with that: the
# pre-commit hook calls `format --write`, so every commit churned generated
# files; and `format:check` (now a CI step) would fail against a tree that had
# been built, because tsc's .d.ts output is not written in Prettier's style.
#
# Everything here is generated or vendored. Nothing here is edited by hand.
dist/
dist-demo/
test-results/
playwright-report/
coverage/

# Generated from backend/helpers/report_generator.py's HTML_TEMPLATE — edit the
# template, not this. (Not matched by the format glob today, but it is exactly
# the kind of file that should never be reformatted in place.)
src/demo/issue-report.html
